  "meta": {
    "about": "SoundCraft → audio engine → array engine → PhotoCraft → FigCraft. SoundCraft plays the title track of 'Pits & Pieces' by The Stone Fruits; the audio engine turns the bounce into a spectrogram; the array engine colours it from plum (quiet) to apricot (loud); PhotoCraft paints it in oils; FigCraft sets the band name and title. Change the notes and the cover changes with them.",
    "tags": [
      "music",
      "art",
      "audio-to-image"
    ],
    "title": "An album cover painted by its own music"
  },
